28-line beginning `REJECT ` that includes a decimal `offset=` and a nonempty
29:`expected=` field.  On command-line, grammar-lexing, grammar-parsing, undefined
30:nonterminal, or left-recursion errors, exit 2 and print one line beginning
31:`GRAMMAR_ERROR ` with a useful detail (line information when applicable).
