33-## Grammar format
34-
35:Whitespace is insignificant.  `#` begins a comment through the end of its line.
36:The first directive is `%start NAME`.  Each production has this form:
37-
38-```text
39:Name ::= symbol symbol | another-alternative | ;
40-```
41-
42-The final empty alternative denotes epsilon.  Each rule name is defined once;
43:every referenced nonterminal must be defined.  The tool must diagnose direct
44-and indirect left recursion before attempting recognition rather than recursing
45-forever or crashing.
